# Exported by lumen-static-widgets and driven by no inventory under
# scripts/drive/widgets/ -- M42/T42.5 (R18-F2, docs/plan-drive-identity.md
# §2.4). scripts/check_drive_coverage.sh (in `just static`) refuses an
# exported type that is in neither place.
#
#   Name | owner | reason          -- not driven, and who owes it
#   Name = Entry                    -- driven, by an inventory of another name
#
# Removing a line is the point: an owner who writes the inventory removes
# the entry in the same commit.

# --- interactive, owed (§4: an inventory now would steer around defects
#     other milestones own) ----------------------------------------------
Select | M44 | keyboard row picking is R3-F6; an inventory that avoided it would be vacuous for exactly that action
TextArea | M45 | paste into a TextArea is R8-F4/R10-F5
ScrollView | M44/T44.10 | the index assigned its inventory to M44 (docs/plan-m38-fixes.md §7)
Popup | M44 | reached only through Select and the choosers today; its own inventory comes with Select's
Glass | M27 | a wrapper; takes its child's input, which the child's inventory drives

# --- take no input: nothing to drive, a static claim at most -------------
Label | M27 | takes no input
Image | M27 | takes no input
Fixed | M27 | a layout box; takes no input
Spacer | M27 | a layout box; takes no input
BarChart | M27 | takes no input
LineChart | M27 | takes no input
PieChart | M27 | takes no input
ProgressBar | M27 | takes no input; the showcase animates it by tick
Skeleton | M27 | takes no input
Spinner | M27 | takes no input
Avatar | M27 | takes no input
Badge | M27 | takes no input
Chip | M27 | takes no input
Divider | M27 | takes no input
Icon | M27 | takes no input

# --- not placeable widgets: generics behind their aliases, and data -------
Toggle | n/a | generic; driven as CheckBox, Switch and Radio
Chart | n/a | generic; the three charts are its aliases
Chooser | n/a | generic; driven as PickList, Combobox and Menu
Picker | n/a | generic; driven as its four pickers
Strip | n/a | generic; driven as Tabs, BottomNav and NavigationRail
Veil | n/a | generic; driven as Modal, Sheet and Drawer
Fit | n/a | data (an Image's fit)
Anchor | n/a | data (a Popup's anchor)
Series | n/a | data (a chart's series)
OptionList | n/a | data (a chooser's options)
Branch | n/a | data (a Tree's node)
PageLabel | n/a | data (a Pagination's label)
Span | n/a | data (a RichText span)
Pad | n/a | data (a picker's cell pad)
Item | n/a | data (a strip's item)
Symbol | n/a | data (an Icon's glyph)

# --- driven under another name -------------------------------------------
Collapsible = Accordion
